BT /F1 70 Tf 1 0 0 -1 360 1408 Tm (marked in or with an inch mark is inches too. A bare number of one or more, such as 7.62, 308 or 22, is refused) Tj ET
BT /F1 70 Tf 1 0 0 -1 360 1514 Tm (rather than guessed, because a calibre's name is usually not its bullet's diameter: read as millimetres, 7.62 would be) Tj ET
